{"id":"lvrename.8","lang":"en","desc":"Rename a logical volume.","items":[["Rename an LV using full paths","sudo lvrename {{/dev/vg_name/old_lv}} {{/dev/vg_name/new_lv}}"],["Rename an LV using the volume group and names","sudo lvrename {{vg_name}} {{old_lv}} {{new_lv}}"],["Answer \"yes\" to any prompts","sudo lvrename {{[-y|--yes]}} {{/dev/vg_name/old_lv}} {{/dev/vg_name/new_lv}}"]],"version":"v2.3","source":"https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/pages/linux/lvrename.md"}